  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program to develop the capacity of National Statistics Institute (INE) is co-financed by Denmark, Norway and Sweden with Denmark as the lead agency and a consortium of their three statistics offices, ScanStat, as the supporting consultant. The project is based on a five-year statistical plan 2003-2007 and supports institutional development of INE strenghtening the national statistical system and</narrative>
